2026-09-25 M5 review R1-F4: period labels: an Indian range names the year it ends in (FY2025-26 = FY2026), 1H/2H are halves, and date labels resolve from their end date ("three months ended June 30, 2026", "year ended December 31, 2025"; "as of June 30, 2026" is a point in time, start = end).
